%SIXMD 1
# @?SORT - SORT S6REC TEXT RECORDS

## DESCRIPTION

LEXICALLY SORTS AT MOST 32 S6REC RECORDS OF AT MOST 120 CHARACTERS EACH.

USAGE IS 'SORT'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/SORT
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/SORT.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

